@faction Horde
@levels 44-50
@zone The Hinterlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Revantusk Village: the Vilebranch trolls, the Wildhammer messages, Elder Torntusk and the Hinterlands wildlife.
@next Both_UngoroCrater

