accept Message to the Wildhammer | Otho Moji'ko.
accept Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions [optional]
accept Kidnapped Elder Torntusk! | Primal Torntusk.
complete Snapjaws, Mon! | Turtles along the coast.
complete Gammerita, Mon! | Gammerita, the large turtle on the coast.
complete Stalking the Stalkers | Silvermane Stalkers.
complete Hunt the Savages | Savage Owlbeasts.
complete Avenging the Fallen | Wildhammer dwarves.
complete Vilebranch Hooligans | Vilebranch trolls.
complete Lard Lost His Lunch | The Wildhammer camp by the coast.
complete Cannibalistic Cousins | Vilebranch Scalpers.
complete Message to the Wildhammer | Highvale area Wildhammer.
turnin Snapjaws, Mon!
turnin Gammerita, Mon!
turnin Stalking the Stalkers
turnin Hunt the Savages
turnin Avenging the Fallen
turnin Vilebranch Hooligans
